Lunduke's Linux Kernel (lunduke-linux-kernel)
=============================================

Metapackage for linux-image-7.2.6-lunduke (ABI lcos15). Recommends matching
headers.

LCOS 0.8 ISOs shipped 7.2.6-lcos12 (that config stays frozen). lcos13
and lcos14 stay frozen. This metapackage is the lcos15 revision of the
same 7.2.6-lunduke image name. On older LCOS releases that still ship a
Distro/Devuan kernel, install from the apt overlay, reboot, and pick
7.2.6-lunduke in GRUB (or set it once).

  sudo apt update
  sudo apt install lunduke-linux-kernel

Apt overlay: https://lcos.lunduke.com/apt

lcos15: ax88179_178a, asix, and cdc_ncm (ASIX USB Ethernet, LCOS#100);
tun (CONFIG_TUN=m, LCOS#87); kvm, kvm-intel, and kvm-amd
(CONFIG_KVM=m, CONFIG_KVM_INTEL=m, CONFIG_KVM_AMD=m, LCOS#103).
CONFIG_VFIO and CONFIG_VHOST_NET stay unset.
No Forced Rust. No firmware blob. lcos12, lcos13, and lcos14 stay frozen.
